ya makhluk terkuat selalu membawanya kembali ke masa lalu setiap kali dia mati.\r\nMeski sekuat itu, dia tetap tidak mampu menyelamatkan dunia dari kegilaan para naga yang menghancurkan segalanya.\r\n– Waktu dunia akan segera dimulai kembali.\r\nKetika jarum jam kembali bergerak seperti seharusnya, Regresi ke7 pun dimulai.\r\nUntungnya kali ini Yu Jitae mulai memahami cara meyelesaikan masalah ini.","folderCdn":"Kidnapped_Dragons","coverImage":"https://minio.imgkc1.my.id/prod/series/kidnapped-dragon/cover/kidnap1.webp?X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&X-Amz-Content-Sha256=UNSIGNED-PAYLOAD&X-Amz-Credential=Zgozh0pCiplFv4J3%2F20260610%2Fap-northeast-1%2Fs3%2Faws4_request&X-Amz-Date=20260610T114600Z&X-Amz-Expires=86400&X-Amz-Signature=3895c31ebbc169b1f24c6fe7b67b04a22965c33d560f6c538babf1f1223bd22c&X-Amz-SignedHeaders=host&x-amz-checksum-mode=ENABLED&x-id=GetObject","totalViews":1021,"animeStatus":null,"bannerIndex":9,"nativeTitle":"Kidnapping Dragon","releaseDate":"2025","monthlyViews":1021,"bookmarkCount":126,"isRecommended":true,"totalChapters":"46","animeAdaptation":false,"backgroundImage":"https://minio.imgkc1.my.id/prod/series/kidnapped-dragon/background/BannerNaga.jpg?X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&X-Amz-Content-Sha256=UNSIGNED-PAYLOAD&X-Amz-Credential=Zgozh0pCiplFv4J3%2F20260610%2Fap-northeast-1%2Fs3%2Faws4_request&X-Amz-Date=20260610T114600Z&X-Amz-Expires=86400&X-Amz-Signature=a1b4e973974e05bf36aeb6bcedc47183d345ba0d47f930ccd26e0d4bf02a1d24&X-Amz-SignedHeaders=host&x-amz-checksum-mode=ENABLED&x-id=GetObject","genres":[{"id":19,"data":{"name":"Action","description":"Action genre from Komikcast"},"createdAt":"2026-01-16T21:39:12.772+07:00","updatedAt":"2026-01-30T06:39:52.655+07:00"},{"id":28,"data":{"name":"Fantasy","description":"Fantasy genre from Komikcast"},"createdAt":"2026-01-16T21:39:12.772+07:00","updatedAt":"2026-01-30T06:39:52.655+07:00"},{"id":22,"data":{"name":"Comedy","description":"Comedy genre from Komikcast"},"createdAt":"2026-01-16T21:39:12.77